  "summary": {
    "en": {
      "caveats": "The findings are based on a single, qualitative tracking study of one neighborhood redevelopment project in Chongqing.",
      "what": "This tracking study analyzes the entire urban redevelopment process of Shibati, a historic neighborhood in Chongqing, China. It traces how socially and culturally constructed memories and counter-memories are converted into calculable, tradable economic capital to optimize market positioning.",
